        <item>
            <title>2.0.84</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:11:14 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/lwghb/SuperScreenshot</link>
            <sparkle:version>284</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.0.84</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[截图工具条左侧新增大号录屏按钮，旁边增加齿轮设置入口。可预先设置并自动保存帧率、码率和系统声音，之后点击录屏即可直接开始，无需再点击一次“开始录屏”。

录制参数会根据当前屏幕和选区自动适配。录屏启动失败时会恢复选区编辑并提示错误。
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/lwghb/SuperScreenshot/releases/download/v2.0.84/SuperScreenshot-v2.0.84-Universal.zip" length="3068357" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="w7dyxl8n/iJwgMth+Un4JSyus1wXMIh9Wz2LVvhVbU5JEIPq59MwK+YjnSRQbmfkkJg6Vzem0qwR8sx9g6XYCw=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>2.0.83</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:50:32 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/lwghb/SuperScreenshot</link>
            <sparkle:version>283</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.0.83</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[截图、长截图及录屏编辑新增自由画笔，按下并拖动即可绘制任意线条，单击可画圆点。支持预设和自定义颜色，以及 1–24 pt 粗细调节。

每笔可整体撤销、删除；切换箭头工具可选中并移动已有笔画。笔画会保留在截图和视频导出结果中。
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/lwghb/SuperScreenshot/releases/download/v2.0.83/SuperScreenshot-v2.0.83-Universal.zip" length="3069762" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="tYXi43lXP99FYGeB4VB2rxPPUhEu+bSSNWxnQzMsrgsibdvTYqgfAOi+0z+57LD8o8/ZYQkQ0k4ivE/AR7u4DA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>2.0.82</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 10:58:04 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/lwghb/SuperScreenshot</link>
            <sparkle:version>282</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.0.82</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[修复冻结截图蒙层位于标注画布上方、导致箭头、文字、形状和马赛克绘制后不可见的问题，标注现在会在绘制过程中即时显示。

优化原位标注界面的选区边缘操作：外侧缩放容错保持 20 pt，内侧缩至 5 pt，减少对画布标注操作的干扰。
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/lwghb/SuperScreenshot/releases/download/v2.0.82/SuperScreenshot-v2.0.82-Universal.zip" length="3062414" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="uqekvFw3QwtXc76Ou2s38opV/3weduyD/gLFz5CMxHlF1NGjQsAsliLAg1Ao2eJJAzcrMfTMKMR/PbPd0srSCw=="/>
        </item>
